4.3 Make the change
Open src/main/resources/templates/team.html. Between the TEAM MEMBERS comments, add your card below any that are already there:
&lt;div class="team-member"&gt;
    &lt;h2&gt;Aoife Byrne&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Employer vertical&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
Check every &lt;div&gt; you open has its closing &lt;/div&gt;.
Run the app (step 1.5) and check your card appears at http://localhost:8080/team. Then run the build CI will run:
./mvnw verify
